# Bench / operator override: hold the valve ON for at most manual_override_timeout_s, or cancel. Subordinate to every
# fail-safe (disarm, disabled, watchdog not ready). Owner: dyx3_spray. A backend request is only a request.
bool on
---
bool accepted
uint8 REASON_OK=0
uint8 REASON_DISABLED=1
uint8 REASON_DISARMED=2
uint8 REASON_WATCHDOG_NOT_READY=3
uint8 reason_code
